Taxi ID
   ↓
Sort trips chronologically
   ↓
Check gap between trips
   ↓
Gap ≥ 8 hours?
   ├── YES → NEW operational block
   └── NO  → SAME operational block
   ↓
For each block:
   ├── elapsed block duration
   └── SUM(trip_seconds) = active trip hours
   ↓
active_trip_hours > 12
   ↓
Potential Overworker